        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-1955] The message \"SessionStopRes\" shall contain the ResponseCode \"FAILED_NoServiceRenegotiationSupported\" if a SessionStopReq with ChargingSession set to \"ServiceRenegotiation\" is received, and the first ServiceDiscoveryRes message of the service session had the ServiceRenegotiationSupported set to \"False\".",
            "block_bbox": [
