        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-1956] The message \"ServiceSelectionRes\" shall contain the ResponseCode \"FAILED_NoServiceRenegotiationSupported\" if the first ServiceDiscoveryRes message of the service session had the ServiceRenegotiationSupported set to \"False\" and the EVCC, after waking up from a Pause, is selecting a different set of ServiceIDs or ParameterSetIDs from the first ServiceSelectionReq of the service session.",
